[2026-03-15T01:17:52.725Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GPf78icrErhceCjJG138Y2","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me compile a comprehensive summary of all the files I found:\n\n## Summary of Write Review Page Files\n\nI've thoroughly searched the `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone` directory and found all source files related to the Write Review page for route `/trips/:bookingId/review`. Here are the complete findings:\n\n### 1. **Review Page Component**\n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/WriteReview.tsx`\n  - Main page component that handles the `/trips/:bookingId/review` route\n  - Fetches booking details using Redux thunk\n  - Shows loading, error, success, and form states\n  - Integrates PropertyBookingContext and ReviewForm components\n\n### 2. **PropertyBookingContext Component**\n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyBookingContext.tsx`\n  - Displays booking information card with property image, title, location, dates, guest count, and price\n  - Formats dates and calculates number of nights\n  - Receives booking data as props from WriteReview page\n\n### 3. **Review-Related Components**\n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ReviewForm.tsx`\n  - Form component for submitting reviews\n  - Integrates RatingSliders for rating inputs\n  - Handles validation of all rating categories\n  - Provides textarea for review comments\n  - Submit and Cancel buttons\n  \n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/RatingSliders.tsx`\n  - Reusable rating slider component with star display\n  - 6 rating categories: Overall, Cleanliness, Accuracy, Communication, Location, Value\n  - Range input from 0-5 stars with visual feedback\n\n### 4. **Reviews API Endpoint (Netlify Function)**\n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/reviews.ts`\n  - POST endpoint: Creates new reviews with validation\n  - GET endpoint: Retrieves reviews by guest_id or property_id\n  - DELETE endpoint: Removes reviews\n  - Validates required fields and checks for duplicate reviews per booking\n  - Prevents duplicate reviews for the same booking\n\n### 5. **Bookings API Endpoint (Netlify Function)**\n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/bookings.ts`\n  - POST: Creates new bookings\n  - GET: Fetches user bookings with property details and review status (includes `has_review` flag)\n  - PUT: Updates booking status\n  - DELETE: Removes bookings or resets seed data\n  - Joins with properties and property_images tables for booking context\n\n### 6. **Routing Configuration**\n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`\n  - Route definition at line 21: `<Route path=\"/trips/:bookingId/review\" element={<WriteReview />} />`\n  - Imports WriteReview component\n\n### 7. **Redux State Management**\n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/reviewFormSlice.ts`\n  - `fetchBookingForReview` thunk: Calls `/api/bookings?guest_id=...` endpoint to retrieve and validate the booking\n  - `submitReview` thunk: POSTs review data to `/api/reviews`\n  - Validation logic: Ensures booking is completed, guest owns the booking, and no duplicate review exists\n  - BookingDetail interface with all necessary booking and property information\n  \n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/store.ts`\n  - Redux store configuration that includes reviewFormReducer\n\n### 8. **Seed Data File**\n- **File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n  - Creates test data including:\n    - Users (hosts and guests): IDs starting with 'a' prefix\n    - Properties: IDs starting with 'b' prefix\n    - Bookings: IDs starting with 'e' prefix (examples on lines 291-300)\n    - Reviews: Examples showing booking-to-review relationships (lines 303-307)\n    - Property images and amenities\n  - Sample bookings with various statuses (completed, confirmed, pending, cancelled)\n  - Sample reviews for completed bookings (e.g., booking `e1111111-1111-1111-